# Files uploaded to Cloud Build for `gcloud run deploy --source .`.
# The image only needs Dockerfile, live-timing-upstream.js,
# live-timing-store.js, relay/ and server/race-results-import.js (the relay
# mirrors the read-only results-import endpoints), so everything heavy or
# private stays out.
